# overseer source — re-include from the broad `bots/**/` rule (line 8) which excludes the
# whole bots/_supervisor/ parent dir. Three-part negate: un-ignore the dir, re-ignore its
# contents (keep runtime artifacts out), then whitelist only the two source .mjs.
!bots/_supervisor/
bots/_supervisor/*
!bots/_supervisor/bb-readers.mjs
!bots/_supervisor/overseer-snapshot.mjs
